12+62 \\\\ A & =\\frac{40}{10} \\\\ A & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $A=4,$ $B=1,$ and $C=-3.$ Therefore, our final result is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}-43x-20}{({x}^{2}+3)(x-11)}=\\frac{4x+1}{({x}^{2}+3)}-\\frac{3}{(x-11)}.\n$$" 13194139534148 true] [17592186278752 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278753 13194139534148 true] [17592186278752 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278754 13194139534148 true] [17592186278752 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278755 13194139534148 true] [17592186278752 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278756 13194139534148 true] [17592186278752 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278757 13194139534148 true] [17592186278752 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534148 true] [17592186278752 1041 "selection" 13194139534148 true] [17592186278752 1104 #edb/ref 17592186278754 13194139534148 true] [17592186278752 1110 #uuid "124787b1-5580-54cb-ac81-a6486c174ec7" 13194139534148 true] [17592186278753 1034 "\\frac{2x+9}{({x}^{2}+3)}-\\frac{6}{(x-11)}" 13194139534148 true] [17592186278753 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534148 true] [17592186278753 1111 #uuid "e55f486a-bba8-5b12-8050-b37ad1324a60" 13194139534148 true] [17592186278754 1034 "\\frac{4x+1}{({x}^{2}+3)}-\\frac{3}{(x-11)}" 13194139534148 true] [17592186278754 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534148 true] [17592186278754 1111 #uuid "16bcf5b2-d66a-54b2-9e2e-c0287929116f" 13194139534148 true] [17592186278755 1034 "\\frac{x+4}{({x}^{2}+3)}+\\frac{7}{(x-11)}" 13194139534148 true] [17592186278755 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534148 true] [17592186278755 1111 #uuid "3afbe726-981d-5ba5-b433-35e0d24bec16" 13194139534148 true] [17592186278756 1034 "\\frac{x+5}{({x}^{2}+3)}-\\frac{4}{(x-11)}" 13194139534148 true] [17592186278756 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534148 true] [17592186278756 1111 #uuid "ed08a7a2-8f22-58ab-9817-a9f9a832e161" 13194139534148 true] [17592186278757 1034 "\\frac{5x+3}{({x}^{2}+3)}+\\frac{2}{(x-11)}" 13194139534148 true] [17592186278757 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534148 true] [17592186278757 1111 #uuid "